OL,3,GNEWSA'I've taken an extra job to pay
OL,4,Afor heating oil'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from East Sussex says she is
OL,7,Fhaving to take on extra work to pay for
OL,8,Fthe soaring cost of her heating oil.
OL,10,FSheila Williams, from Golden Cross, has
OL,11,Ftaken on a waitress job for the winter
OL,12,Fto help her pay her bills.
OL,14,FShe said her oil bill had doubled since
OL,15,Fthe start of 2026 and the extra job was
OL,16,Fneeded to help pay for it.
OL,18,FA government spokesperson said: "We
OL,19,Fhave pledged #53m in support for
OL,20,Fvulnerable households on heating oil
OL,21,Fand removed the 4% tariff on home
OL,22,Fheating oil."
